.", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[48, 1499], [1135, 1500], [1135, 1536], [48, 1535]]}, {"text": "Programming Area (Script Area) is the actual working space where you can drag", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[51, 1556], [1179, 1559], [1179, 1595], [51, 1592]]}, {"text": "anddropCodeBlocksthataretobeexecuted.", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[53, 1606], [675, 1606], [675, 1635], [53, 1635]]}, {"text": "65", "conf": 0.665, "box": [[606, 1657], [645, 1657], [645, 1685], [606, 1685]]}, {"text": "Unit 4:Programming", "conf": 0.853, "box": [[791, 1658], [970, 1661], [970, 1683], [791, 1681]]}]}